  "steps": [
    "Boil 35g of Soya chunks and squeeze them well to drain out all the excess liquid.",
    "To a bowl add soya chunks, chopped garlic, 2-3 tbsp onion, 1-2 chopped green chillies, chopped dhaniya, 1/2 cup boiled peas, 1 tsp aamchur powder, salt, 1/2 tsp haldi, 1 tsp red chilli powder, 1 tsp garam masala, chaat masala and pepper. Grind this into a fine paste.",
    "Now make parathas with normal roti dough/methi roti dough. Make sure to fit as much masala as you can into a super thin roti because you don’t wanna make it higher in calories. I am able to fit this into 2 thin parathas.",
    "Cook the parathas on low flame and apply less than 1/2 tsp ghee on both sides.",
    "Mix 120g greek yogurt with chaat masala, pinch of sugar, red chilli powder, black salt and pomegranate."
  ],
